    "verse": "bhaktiṁ harau bhagavati pravahann ajasram\nānanda-bāṣpa-kalayā muhur ardyamānaḥ\nviklidyamāna-hṛdayaḥ pulakācitāṅgo\nnātmānam asmarad asāv iti mukta-liṅgaḥ",
